### Infix expression
  An infix expression is the standard human-readable format for math
  expressions, where:
  Operators (+, -, *, /) are written between operands.

--> BOD-MAS RULES:-
--> D,M > A,S ---> D and M have same preference also A and S
---> if equal preference then we go left to right

